flowchart TD
    title User Login Flow

    A[Enter Email & Password] --> B{Valid Format?}
    B -->|No| C[Show Validation Error]
    B -->|Yes| D[Call Auth API]
    D --> E{User Exists?}
    E -->|No| F[Show "User Not Found"]
    E -->|Yes| G[Verify Password]
    G --> H{Password OK?}
    H -->|No| I[Show "Invalid Password"]
    H -->|Yes| J[Generate JWT Token]
    J --> K[Return Token]
